# 《星丘残响》Hoshigaoka Echoes — Git 忽略规则
# 依据 V2.1.4 M6：禁止把 .godot 缓存、dist 构建、Steam 凭证、密钥、临时包提交仓库

# --- Godot 引擎缓存与导入产物 ---
.godot/
*.translation

# --- 导出产物（L9：构建输出放 dist/，绝不混入 res://）---
dist/
build/
*.exe
*.pck
*.zip
export_presets.cfg.bak

# --- IDE / 编辑器 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- 操作系统 ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- 敏感凭证（N4 / O3：凭证绝不入库）---
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
steam_appid.txt
steam_build_credentials*
.env
.env.*

# --- 临时文件 ---
*.tmp
*.log
crash_*.txt
